; The export list of amdhip64_7.dll, the AMD ABI face of this runtime (runtime\amd_abi.cpp).
; The ROCm user libraries of TheRock import their HIP names from a DLL of this name.
;
; 138 names:
;   the 55 of amdhip64.def, less hipGetDeviceProperties: its structure is ours, and a program
;     built against AMD's header calls hipGetDevicePropertiesR0600 instead;
;   the 83 that the ROCm libraries import and amdhip64.def does not have, from the import census
;     of the nightly 10.3.0a20261030 packages (scratch\t35\torch-hip\imp-hip.tsv);
;   bc250amdGetFaceCounters, ours, which reads the counters of the face.
; Three names mean something else in AMD's header than in ours, so they export a function of
; amd_abi.cpp under AMD's name: hipDeviceGetAttribute (AMD's attribute numbers),
; hipEventCreateWithFlags (AMD's flags) and hipLaunchCooperativeKernel (AMD's LDS size is an
; unsigned int, ours a size_t). build-amd-abi.ps1 checks that every imported name is
; here and that the built DLL exports exactly this list.
LIBRARY amdhip64_7.dll
EXPORTS
bc250amdGetFaceCounters
bc250hipGetCounters
bc250hipResetCounters
__hipPopCallConfiguration
__hipPushCallConfiguration
__hipRegisterFatBinary
__hipRegisterFunction
__hipRegisterManagedVar
__hipRegisterVar
__hipUnregisterFatBinary
hipCtxGetCurrent
hipCtxSetCurrent
hipDeviceCanAccessPeer
hipDeviceDisablePeerAccess
hipDeviceEnablePeerAccess
hipDeviceGet
